%abc-2.1
% Melody, chords and words transcribed by hand from the writers' own lead sheet,
% sources/sheetPdf.pdf (songsofpraise.org/pdf/brings.pdf), bar for bar. The PDF has no
% printed bar numbers; bars here count from 1 in the PDF's order, and its road map
% (D.C., D.S., "Last to Coda") is kept as written, not unfolded. The piano part is not
% transcribed. Where the PDF puts two chords over one whole note or whole rest, the bar
% is split into two tied halves so the second chord lands on beat 3.
% Checked against the melody track of sources/tune.mid (tools/check-abc-midi.py --track 6):
% every pitch agrees. The MIDI plays the eighths swung; the PDF writes them straight.
